  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3076 specifies the requirements and architecture for ICN-enabled edge network in IMT-2020. From the service and network operation point of view, it discusses detailed requirements of ICN-enabled edge network in IMT-2020. It provides architecture of ICN-enabled edge network and it describes the key functions and interfaces to satisfy the requirements of ICN‑enabled edge network.</abstract>
